# Brazil X-Ray by Government

**{{n_total}} numbers from a viral infographic about eight Brazilian governments, checked one by one against public data under a rule fixed in code; then the X-ray of what it left out: {{n_term_ind}} hash-chained series since 1964, a pre-registered index of living conditions and the peer-reviewed literature on each episode. No score of merit.**

